[{:db/id 17592186129164 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-2c3b5fdf-e81f-5835-8ccd-060ca0cabad4" "question-537e39b9-c554-5e1b-a6dd-8e198218680c" "question-59328584-c57e-5239-919a-177255c910ca"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186129165 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-5a0ea10f-00cc-5f1e-9234-e05424315508"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186129166 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-ec2c5b36-cc64-59b6-941f-e3ef54e2e8b8" "question-5334bf5b-4c65-5a0d-a9f7-2b79a628b6c8"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186128985 :question/problem "Which of the following equalities are true given that\n$D = \\big\\{ (x,y) \\: : \\: 0 \\leq x \\leq 2, \\: 0 \\leq y \\leq 1 \\big\\}.$\n\nI. $\\displaystyle \\iint\\limits_{D} e^{\\sqrt{xy}} \\,\\text{d}A  = \\int_{0}^{1}  \\int_{0}^{2}e^{\\sqrt{xy}}\\,  \\text{d}y \\, \\text{d}x$\n\nII. $\\displaystyle \\iint\\limits_{D} e^{\\sqrt{xy}}\\,\\text{d}A  = \\int_{0}^{2}  \\int_{0}^{1} e^{\\sqrt{xy}}\\, \\text{d}y\\,  \\text{d}x$\n\nIII. $\\displaystyle \\iint\\limits_{D} e^{\\sqrt{xy}} \\,\\text{d}A = \\int_{0}^{1}  \\int_{0}^{2}e^{\\sqrt{xy}}\\,  \\text{d}x \\, \\text{d}y$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "question-2c3b5fdf-e81f-5835-8ccd-060ca0cabad4" :question/id #uuid "2c3b5fdf-e81f-5835-8ccd-060ca0cabad4" :question/math-academy-id "q-73556" :question/problem "Evaluate the repeated integral ${\\int }_{2}^{4}{\\int }_{0}^{1/2}3y{e}^{4x}\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $x$, treating $y$ as a constant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{2}^{4}[{\\int }_{0}^{1/2}3y{e}^{4x}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y & ={\\int }_{2}^{4}3y[{\\int }_{0}^{1/2}{e}^{4x}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{2}^{4}3y{[\\frac{{e}^{4x}}{4}]}_{0}^{1/2}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{2}^{4}3y(\\frac{{e}^{2}}{4}-\\frac{{e}^{0}}{4})\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{2}^{4}\\frac{3}{4}y({e}^{2}-1)\\,\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{2}^{4}\\frac{3}{4}y({e}^{2}-1)\\,\\text{d}y & =\\frac{3}{4}({e}^{2}-1){\\int }_{2}^{4}y\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={[\\frac{3}{4}({e}^{2}-1)\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}]}_{2}^{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{4}({e}^{2}-1)(\\frac{{4}^{2}}{2}-\\frac{{2}^{2}}{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{9}{2}({e}^{2}-1)\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-dbeb3358-f2ea-5a4a-8dce-c539f418c1e0"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-dbeb3358-f2ea-5a4a-8dce-c539f418c1e0" :answer-field/id #uuid "dbeb3358-f2ea-5a4a-8dce-c539f418c1e0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-e54da0da-f5e4-504a-8ffb-b66a2d635d60" :answer-field/choices ["answer-1c72710f-c2e6-5f98-9934-8c0e10db39f6" "answer-ac5cce45-dc22-5511-8d13-472d6c0e63cd" "answer-406a5e50-f9e7-5e1a-b74c-548956a80fce" "answer-e54da0da-f5e4-504a-8ffb-b66a2d635d60" "answer-9b8dbd40-65b4-55c4-825d-2641cb8d37e6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1c72710f-c2e6-5f98-9934-8c0e10db39f6" :answer/id #uuid "1c72710f-c2e6-5f98-9934-8c0e10db39f6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3({e}^{2}+1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ac5cce45-dc22-5511-8d13-472d6c0e63cd" :answer/id #uuid "ac5cce45-dc22-5511-8d13-472d6c0e63cd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}({e}^{2}-6)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-406a5e50-f9e7-5e1a-b74c-548956a80fce" :answer/id #uuid "406a5e50-f9e7-5e1a-b74c-548956a80fce" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}({e}^{2}-\\operatorname{ln}⁡2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e54da0da-f5e4-504a-8ffb-b66a2d635d60" :answer/id #uuid "e54da0da-f5e4-504a-8ffb-b66a2d635d60" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{9}{2}({e}^{2}-1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9b8dbd40-65b4-55c4-825d-2641cb8d37e6" :answer/id #uuid "9b8dbd40-65b4-55c4-825d-2641cb8d37e6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{{e}^{2}-1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-537e39b9-c554-5e1b-a6dd-8e198218680c" :question/id #uuid "537e39b9-c554-5e1b-a6dd-8e198218680c" :question/math-academy-id "q-129548" :question/problem "${\\int }_{1}^{e}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}\\frac{1}{y{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $x$, treating $y$ as a constant: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{e}[{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}\\frac{1}{y{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y & ={\\int }_{1}^{e}\\frac{1}{y}[{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}\\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{e}\\frac{1}{y}[{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}{sec}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{e}\\frac{1}{y}[\\operatorname{tan}⁡x]_{0}^{\\pi /4}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{e}\\frac{1}{y}(\\operatorname{tan}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4})-\\operatorname{tan}⁡0)\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{e}\\frac{1}{y}\\,\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nThen, we integrate with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{e}\\frac{1}{y}\\,\\text{d}y & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡|y|{|}_{1}^{e} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡e-\\operatorname{ln}⁡1 \\\\  & =1-0 \\\\  & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-1c915c1b-8d9a-5d22-96f6-4f765b2be4a6"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-1c915c1b-8d9a-5d22-96f6-4f765b2be4a6" :answer-field/id #uuid "1c915c1b-8d9a-5d22-96f6-4f765b2be4a6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-bece9adc-021f-5779-a2a6-dc4757a9f75c" :answer-field/choices ["answer-9c03be65-b878-58d4-b8c0-c80d0b51e294" "answer-bece9adc-021f-5779-a2a6-dc4757a9f75c" "answer-99e7e82f-77a2-5e4c-b50f-29924bf0f0fb" "answer-812b461a-180e-543d-b8c3-60aec2c44810" "answer-f7b8ce6c-3373-5ebe-bc16-7d2a05cfc3b4"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9c03be65-b878-58d4-b8c0-c80d0b51e294" :answer/id #uuid "9c03be65-b878-58d4-b8c0-c80d0b51e294" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-bece9adc-021f-5779-a2a6-dc4757a9f75c" :answer/id #uuid "bece9adc-021f-5779-a2a6-dc4757a9f75c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-99e7e82f-77a2-5e4c-b50f-29924bf0f0fb" :answer/id #uuid "99e7e82f-77a2-5e4c-b50f-29924bf0f0fb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "e" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-812b461a-180e-543d-b8c3-60aec2c44810" :answer/id #uuid "812b461a-180e-543d-b8c3-60aec2c44810" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "e+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f7b8ce6c-3373-5ebe-bc16-7d2a05cfc3b4" :answer/id #uuid "f7b8ce6c-3373-5ebe-bc16-7d2a05cfc3b4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "e-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-59328584-c57e-5239-919a-177255c910ca" :question/id #uuid "59328584-c57e-5239-919a-177255c910ca" :question/math-academy-id "q-37925" :question/problem "${\\int }_{1}^{2}{\\int }_{1}^{2}{e}^{x+y}\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $x$, treating $y$ as a constant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{2}[{\\int }_{1}^{2}{e}^{x+y}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}[{e}^{x+y}]_{1}^{2}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}({e}^{y+2}-{e}^{y+1})\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{2}({e}^{y+2}-{e}^{y+1})\\text{d}y & =[{e}^{y+2}-{e}^{y+1}]_{1}^{2} \\\\  & ={e}^{4}-{e}^{3}-({e}^{3}-{e}^{2}) \\\\  & ={e}^{4}-2{e}^{3}+{e}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-e30a14d3-7c0e-5fdd-bd22-94759a75c19a"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-e30a14d3-7c0e-5fdd-bd22-94759a75c19a" :answer-field/id #uuid "e30a14d3-7c0e-5fdd-bd22-94759a75c19a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-a43bc8bc-5873-54d8-a5a8-9571bae2c78a" :answer-field/choices ["answer-4cfce336-fbf4-557e-8201-f3dbb00f8284" "answer-9bcf86e3-bcff-5511-b472-afb6bf1e0805" "answer-c587c36b-a821-5e25-ba21-ae0e3fae2e44" "answer-a43bc8bc-5873-54d8-a5a8-9571bae2c78a" "answer-555208da-41d1-5e38-a07f-d469aa40cdc0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4cfce336-fbf4-557e-8201-f3dbb00f8284" :answer/id #uuid "4cfce336-fbf4-557e-8201-f3dbb00f8284" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{2}-e" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9bcf86e3-bcff-5511-b472-afb6bf1e0805" :answer/id #uuid "9bcf86e3-bcff-5511-b472-afb6bf1e0805" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{4}+2{e}^{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c587c36b-a821-5e25-ba21-ae0e3fae2e44" :answer/id #uuid "c587c36b-a821-5e25-ba21-ae0e3fae2e44" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{4}+{e}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a43bc8bc-5873-54d8-a5a8-9571bae2c78a" :answer/id #uuid "a43bc8bc-5873-54d8-a5a8-9571bae2c78a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{4}-2{e}^{3}+{e}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-555208da-41d1-5e38-a07f-d469aa40cdc0" :answer/id #uuid "555208da-41d1-5e38-a07f-d469aa40cdc0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{4}-{e}^{3}+{e}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186382242 :question/problem "Evaluate the double integral ${∬}_{D}9{x}^{2}{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}A,$ where \n$D=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,-2\\le x\\le 2,\\,-1\\le y\\le 1\\}.$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186339082 :question/problem "Evaluate the double integral ${∬}_{D}y{e}^{xy}\\,\\text{d}A,$ where \n$D=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 1,\\,0\\le y\\le 4\\}.$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186339083 :question/problem "Evaluate the double integral ${∬}_{D}{e}^{x+y}\\,\\text{d}A,$ where \n$D=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 1,\\,0\\le y\\le 2\\}.$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186129622 :question/problem "Evaluate the double integral ${∬}_{D}\\sqrt{{x}^{3}y}\\,\\text{d}A$, where $D=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 1,\\,1\\le y\\le 4\\}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we express our double integral as a repeated integral:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}\\sqrt{{x}^{3}y}\\,\\text{d}A & ={\\int }_{1}^{4}[{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\sqrt{{x}^{3}y}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $x$, treating $y$ as a constant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{4}[{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\sqrt{{x}^{3}y}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y & ={\\int }_{1}^{4}\\sqrt{y}[{\\int }_{0}^{1}{x}^{3/2}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{4}\\sqrt{y}{[\\frac{2}{5}{x}^{5/2}]}_{0}^{1}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{4}\\sqrt{y}(\\frac{2}{5}(1)^{5/2}-\\frac{2}{5}(0)^{5/2})\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{4}\\frac{2}{5}\\sqrt{y}\\,\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we integrate with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{4}\\frac{2}{5}\\sqrt{y}\\,\\text{d}y & =\\frac{2}{5}{\\int }_{1}^{4}{y}^{1/2}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{5}{[\\frac{2{y}^{3/2}}{3}]}_{1}^{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{5}\\cdot \\frac{2}{3}((4)^{3/2}-(1)^{3/2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{15}(8-1) \\\\  & =\\frac{28}{15}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186127213 :answer-field/correct 17592186127218 :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "question-5a0ea10f-00cc-5f1e-9234-e05424315508" :question/id #uuid "5a0ea10f-00cc-5f1e-9234-e05424315508" :question/math-academy-id "q-73595" :question/problem "Evaluate the double integral ${∬}_{D}\\frac{2x}{{y}^{4}}\\,\\text{d}A,$ where $D=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,2\\le x\\le 4,\\,1\\le y\\le 2\\}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we express our double integral as a repeated integral:      \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}\\frac{2x}{{y}^{4}}\\,\\text{d}A & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}[{\\int }_{2}^{4}\\frac{2x}{{y}^{4}}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $x$, treating $y$ as a constant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{2}[{\\int }_{2}^{4}\\frac{2x}{{y}^{4}}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{2}{{y}^{4}}[{\\int }_{2}^{4}x\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{2}{{y}^{4}}{[\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}]}_{2}^{4}\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{2}{{y}^{4}}(\\frac{{4}^{2}}{2}-\\frac{{2}^{2}}{2})\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{12}{{y}^{4}}\\,\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we integrate with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{12}{{y}^{4}}\\,\\text{d}y & ={[-\\frac{4}{{y}^{3}}]}_{1}^{2} \\\\  & =-\\frac{4}{{2}^{3}}+\\frac{4}{{1}^{3}} \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-27b03b87-7f60-5a41-9452-146569702c1e"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-27b03b87-7f60-5a41-9452-146569702c1e" :answer-field/id #uuid "27b03b87-7f60-5a41-9452-146569702c1e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-1f8087da-0be9-5661-8053-ef364f6d08fe" :answer-field/choices ["answer-b2329388-28ae-5d8d-9a05-1bffa3cfe3a6" "answer-258eca96-5244-5ca3-b0df-8541f47f4e9b" "answer-6d559819-b00a-5b69-960c-d3f8320ab0a2" "answer-1f8087da-0be9-5661-8053-ef364f6d08fe" "answer-87b99526-1110-5b37-a9b1-d2cd1aa88253"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b2329388-28ae-5d8d-9a05-1bffa3cfe3a6" :answer/id #uuid "b2329388-28ae-5d8d-9a05-1bffa3cfe3a6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-258eca96-5244-5ca3-b0df-8541f47f4e9b" :answer/id #uuid "258eca96-5244-5ca3-b0df-8541f47f4e9b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6d559819-b00a-5b69-960c-d3f8320ab0a2" :answer/id #uuid "6d559819-b00a-5b69-960c-d3f8320ab0a2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1f8087da-0be9-5661-8053-ef364f6d08fe" :answer/id #uuid "1f8087da-0be9-5661-8053-ef364f6d08fe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{7}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-87b99526-1110-5b37-a9b1-d2cd1aa88253" :answer/id #uuid "87b99526-1110-5b37-a9b1-d2cd1aa88253" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{7}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-ec2c5b36-cc64-59b6-941f-e3ef54e2e8b8" :question/id #uuid "ec2c5b36-cc64-59b6-941f-e3ef54e2e8b8" :question/math-academy-id "q-72136" :question/problem "Which of the following equalities are true given that\n$D=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 2,\\,-1\\le y\\le 1\\}.$\n\nI. ${∬}_{D}\\frac{x-1}{y+2}\\,\\text{d}A={\\int }_{-1}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{x-1}{y+2}\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x$\n\nII. ${∬}_{D}\\frac{x-1}{y+2}\\,\\text{d}A={\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{-1}^{1}\\frac{x-1}{y+2}\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x$\n\nIII. ${∬}_{D}\\frac{x-1}{y+2}\\,\\text{d}A={\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{-1}^{1}\\frac{x-1}{y+2}\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y$" :question/worked-solution "We notice that:\n\n- the limits for the variable $x$ are from $0$ to $2$, and\n\n- the limits for the variable $y$ are from $-1$ to $1.$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}\\frac{x-1}{y+2}\\,\\text{d}A & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}[{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{x-1}{y+2}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since the region of integration is rectangular, we can simply swap the order of integration. This gives\n\n$$\n{∬}_{D}\\frac{x-1}{y+2}\\,\\text{d}A={\\int }_{0}^{2}[{\\int }_{-1}^{1}\\frac{x-1}{y+2}\\,\\text{d}y]\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nSo, the correct answer is \"II only\"." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-f0a1bbcd-9f99-5ffd-9c62-c5d07cca7e90"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-f0a1bbcd-9f99-5ffd-9c62-c5d07cca7e90" :answer-field/id #uuid "f0a1bbcd-9f99-5ffd-9c62-c5d07cca7e90" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-371c3423-1157-51d6-97e6-966f489c5487" :answer-field/choices ["answer-c2466043-9164-57ad-b3f9-ec4567efd6ff" "answer-324de9dd-38ea-5337-bbde-d854373f1914" "answer-a986dfcc-797e-520c-8aef-ae24d77f71bf" "answer-371c3423-1157-51d6-97e6-966f489c5487" "answer-714a7070-159e-549a-85fe-1667dab928ce"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c2466043-9164-57ad-b3f9-ec4567efd6ff" :answer/id #uuid "c2466043-9164-57ad-b3f9-ec4567efd6ff" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-324de9dd-38ea-5337-bbde-d854373f1914" :answer/id #uuid "324de9dd-38ea-5337-bbde-d854373f1914" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a986dfcc-797e-520c-8aef-ae24d77f71bf" :answer/id #uuid "a986dfcc-797e-520c-8aef-ae24d77f71bf" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-371c3423-1157-51d6-97e6-966f489c5487" :answer/id #uuid "371c3423-1157-51d6-97e6-966f489c5487" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-714a7070-159e-549a-85fe-1667dab928ce" :answer/id #uuid "714a7070-159e-549a-85fe-1667dab928ce" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-5334bf5b-4c65-5a0d-a9f7-2b79a628b6c8" :question/id #uuid "5334bf5b-4c65-5a0d-a9f7-2b79a628b6c8" :question/math-academy-id "q-72176" :question/problem "Which of the following equalities are true given that\n$D=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le \\frac{1}{2},\\,0\\le y\\le \\frac{1}{4}\\}.$\n\nI. ${∬}_{D}xy\\sqrt{x+y}\\,\\text{d}A={\\int }_{0}^{1/2}{\\int }_{0}^{1/4}xy\\sqrt{x+y}\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y$\n\nII. ${∬}_{D}xy\\sqrt{x+y}\\,\\text{d}A={\\int }_{0}^{1/4}{\\int }_{0}^{1/2}xy\\sqrt{x+y}\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x$\n\nIII. ${∬}_{D}xy\\sqrt{x+y}\\,\\text{d}A={\\int }_{0}^{1/4}{\\int }_{0}^{1/2}xy\\sqrt{x+y}\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y$" :question/worked-solution "We notice that:    \n\n- the limits for the variable $x$ are from $0$ to $\\frac{1}{2}$, and\n\n- the limits for the variable $y$ are from $0$ to $\\frac{1}{4}.$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}xy\\sqrt{x+y}\\,\\text{d}A & ={\\int }_{0}^{1/4}[{\\int }_{0}^{1/2}xy\\sqrt{x+y}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since the region of integration is rectangular, we can also swap the order of integration. This gives \n\n$$\n{∬}_{D}xy\\sqrt{x+y}\\,\\text{d}A={\\int }_{0}^{1/2}[{\\int }_{0}^{1/4}xy\\sqrt{x+y}\\,\\text{d}y]\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nSo, the correct answer is \"III only\"." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-d2f52b29-b1dd-578a-b67a-9de7263fc4ed"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-d2f52b29-b1dd-578a-b67a-9de7263fc4ed" :answer-field/id #uuid "d2f52b29-b1dd-578a-b67a-9de7263fc4ed" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-f099cea2-4241-50d0-b9de-7635c48e95d3" :answer-field/choices ["answer-27ca5ad7-f8d3-561b-9a26-e9c7eb4baa19" "answer-b71f756d-5060-5655-9f9f-db68c84af53f" "answer-6abefa77-d86f-5a30-92a1-7b7ba370ae0b" "answer-32c82e63-0ba1-5dd4-b1eb-9bb571d4a5f9" "answer-f099cea2-4241-50d0-b9de-7635c48e95d3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-27ca5ad7-f8d3-561b-9a26-e9c7eb4baa19" :answer/id #uuid "27ca5ad7-f8d3-561b-9a26-e9c7eb4baa19" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b71f756d-5060-5655-9f9f-db68c84af53f" :answer/id #uuid "b71f756d-5060-5655-9f9f-db68c84af53f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6abefa77-d86f-5a30-92a1-7b7ba370ae0b" :answer/id #uuid "6abefa77-d86f-5a30-92a1-7b7ba370ae0b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-32c82e63-0ba1-5dd4-b1eb-9bb571d4a5f9" :answer/id #uuid "32c82e63-0ba1-5dd4-b1eb-9bb571d4a5f9" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f099cea2-4241-50d0-b9de-7635c48e95d3" :answer/id #uuid "f099cea2-4241-50d0-b9de-7635c48e95d3" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186130412 :tutorial/content "Consider the surface $z= f(x,y) = 3-x^2-y^2,$ defined over the following rectangle:\n\n$$\nR=[0,1] \\times [0,1] = \\big\\{ (x,y) \\: : \\: 0 \\leq x \\leq 1, \\: 0 \\leq y \\leq 1 \\big\\}.\n$$\n\nA sketch of our surface and its domain is shown below.\n\n![](images/1f/1fdf4668c7e89a9a32ee8e655fe5c80c899a04d25a0f342365560f4d9abdd8fd.png)\n\n \n\nThe **double integral** of $f(x,y)$ over $R,$ denoted\n\n$$\n\\iint\\limits_{R}{ f(x,y) \\, \\mathrm{d}A},\n$$\n\nrepresents the total *signed* volume bounded between the surface $z=f(x,y)$ and the planes $x=0, x=1, y=0, y=1.$\n\nIt can be shown that the double integral \n\n$$\n\\displaystyle \\iint\\limits_{R} {{(3-x^2-y^2) \\, \\mathrm{d}A}},\n$$\n\ncan be evaluated using the repeated integral \n\n$$\n\\displaystyle \\int_0^1\\int_0^1 (3-x^2-y^2) \\, \\mathrm{d}  x\\,  \\mathrm{d}  y.\n$$\n\nNotice that we replace $\\textrm d A$ with $\\textrm d x\\,\\textrm d y$ when writing our double integral as a repeated integral." :db/ensure [:tutorial/validate]} {:db/id 17592186129338 :activity/expected-seconds 960.0 :db/ensure [:activity/validate]}]
